  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 705.02 Initiating a Waiver Request",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 705.02 Initiating a Waiver Request.\n\n(a) Any person who is or would be directly and adversely affected by the strict application of a requirement established in Env-Or 700 may request a waiver thereof.\n\n(b) A request for a waiver shall:\n\n(1) Be submitted in writing to the department;\n\n(2) Include the information specified in Env-Or 705.03;\n\n(3) Be signed as specified in Env-Or 705.04; and\n\n(4) Be submitted as soon as the need for a waiver is identified.\n\nSource. #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10832, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14420, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or700.html"
